part.text:
We need to create a game.js file implementing a simple endless runner per IDEA.md. Canvas with id="game". Should be concise. We'll create basic script: get canvas, set dimensions, define player, obstacles, collectibles, game loop, input space bar to jump, simple gravity, collision detection, score. Use requestAnimationFrame. Minimal.

We'll create /tmp/.../game.js.

But we should check existing files to ensure not overwriting. Use glob to see if game.js exists.{"pattern":"**/game.js"}
